{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Setuccha","html":"<article id='thag1.102'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.102 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.102 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekādasamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Eleven </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Setucchattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Setuccha </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Mānena vañcitāse, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Deceived by conceit, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Saṅkhāresu saṅkilissamānāse; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>defiled among conditions, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Lābhālābhena mathitā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>oppressed by gain and loss, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Samādhiṁ nādhigacchantī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>they don’t reach immersion. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Setuccho thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
